        "63",
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a35484cdc35f4aa61fe69d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>训练员摄像机功能</color>支持的乐曲，在Live播放时可以在<color=#ff9900>一定范围内操作摄像机</color>。\\n可以从<color=#ff9900>滑动操作</color>和<color=#ff9900>陀螺仪操作</color>两种方式中选择操作方法，\\n享受全新感受的Live吧！\\n※陀螺仪操作仅限 iOS 版及 Google Play 版可选。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6ad92949ffce3a9de4965b9322fe7306d075f8016cf77828b0a0500989d602",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984b45fb380449808f7e2ea2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拖动画面上的任意位置可以移动摄像机，\\n通过鼠标滚轮操作可以缩放画面。\\n如果需要将摄像机恢复到初始位置，\\n请点击画面左下角的<color=#ff9900>[摄像机重置]按钮</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bc1019adaeac9a33b5f905329d0fd54c3cff7f4e4d263fd2edee5e1b7d5ec1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6fa183fee408a5940fb1c0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以保存已选择的<color=#ff9900>继承赛马娘编组</color>以便日后调用。最多可保存25个心仪的编组，轻松设置符合育成目标的继承赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c3669471a7cd132eaf9697279215d60b19cabaf585b519f389fdb9802ecbd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a9f62d7c22a4a150706471a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尝试让赛马娘继承<color=#ff9900>思绪（因子）</color>吧。这会提升育成开始时的能力与资质，且在育成中的<color=#ff9900>继承事件</color>里能使赛马娘成长。由于继承不会导致殿堂赛马娘消失，请务必利用此功能培养更强大的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c67a4f7514b23edd7d50dd9078e9649b43c72c66c1b3491941bb1f7e71de61c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f49a175c67827d376d50ff24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以保存已选择的<color=#ff9900>继承赛马娘编组</color>以便日后调用。最多可保存25个心仪的编组，轻松设置符合育成目标的继承赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c3669471a7cd132eaf9697279215d60b19cabaf585b519f389fdb9802ecbd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3961f6178b35627bc896d6aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成员之间可以<color=#ff9900>互相赠送各种物品</color>。\\n彼此的<color=#ff9900>代表赛马娘</color>作为继承赛马娘\\n租借时可享受折扣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f9b0fc91d908b15b7198f4dab730a5d0914aa8b7334cd85872f7b9762f1b47",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b847779a79ed0da5aa0e83e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各项比赛设有多个LEVEL。赢得比赛后将解锁<color=#ff9901>下一个LEVEL</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b5c59fa04f4a1096ca299c297b7f8bca9895b08cf28d996fba8008120c7f6c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e374303cae566164ccae41ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各项比赛的每个LEVEL都设有首胜奖励。通过赢得比赛来获取<color=#ff9901>首胜奖励</color>吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a738a9bc0e30ef6b11454eebe24f4234246defee8ade72539fe8dec9ae1a07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c1f1d59ea9b0227cf0eb66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛的每个LEVEL，每位殿堂赛马娘<color=#ff9901>最多可出赛3次</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b3cf2e72cd0fa3b55a994cb1f028249dd59a2d4c84fb76d1ed8539fd9fd41e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1978a4f055249e7afd9a7455",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9901>存档</color>中，可以随时挑战过去在大师挑战赛中举办过的限时比赛。过去的挑战进度将会被继承。※限时比赛将陆续添加到存档中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73044ce3ca13a4f1f39d66a129726f668a5c9e5a8e5e983d63f28b7317a25509",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0252b00d80d84d07a9310bf4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在训练员手册中，可以<color=#ff9900>跳过</color>日常比赛和团队竞技场等内容！还可以<color=#ff9900>批量跳过</color>各项内容。设定好<color=#ff9900>跳过方针</color>，尽情体验各种游戏内容吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d3385f931e8944922f845e76400f843f6b5fe44395c25596e017acd49e88771",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "314"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
